{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NAMAKORIUM is a chaotic, cooperative multiplayer RTS for up to four players.<br>Command the &quot;sea cleaners&quot;\u2014Namakos (sea cucumbers) left behind by humanity\u2014and clean up the polluted oceans!<br>Plus, Solo Mode lets you choose your style: take it slow and chill, or push for peak efficiency!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/extras/c015cd7c709039b957cb672d805cc085.poster.avif?t=1771564038\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/extras/c015cd7c709039b957cb672d805cc085.webm?t=1771564038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/extras/c015cd7c709039b957cb672d805cc085.mp4?t=1771564038\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you reclaim the beautiful sea?<br>It\u2019s all up to your planning skills, your friends, and your trusty sea cucumbers.<br>Get ready for a frantic, action-packed ocean cleanup operation!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Organize Your Namako Operation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command unique Namakos, gather resources, construct buildings, and clear paths\u2014the tasks are many and time is short.<br>Purify all the pollution before the food runs out!<br>Will your strategy hold up under pressure and succeed with the team?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/extras/d190327ffce1aad3c9d7d1127c8d5362.poster.avif?t=1771564038\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/extras/d190327ffce1aad3c9d7d1127c8d5362.webm?t=1771564038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/extras/d190327ffce1aad3c9d7d1127c8d5362.mp4?t=1771564038\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique Namakos with Special Traits</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shell Namako gathers limestone. Iron Namako is great at mining. Flame Namako and Ice Namako can survive extreme temperatures.<br>Use their distinct abilities to assign roles and conquer each stage together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/extras/397c5cde778c06561d615423330c3789.poster.avif?t=1771564038\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/extras/397c5cde778c06561d615423330c3789.webm?t=1771564038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/extras/397c5cde778c06561d615423330c3789.mp4?t=1771564038\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Restore the Ocean\u2019s Beauty</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you decontaminate, corals bloom, sunlight shines through, and the ocean regains vibrant color.<br>Over 50 types of &quot;Scenic Creatures&quot; will begin to swim in\u2014try to collect them all as you heal the seas!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/extras/3545ce50fbdfb601445d7ed972708cbc.poster.avif?t=1771564038\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/extras/3545ce50fbdfb601445d7ed972708cbc.webm?t=1771564038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/extras/3545ce50fbdfb601445d7ed972708cbc.mp4?t=1771564038\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Beware the \u201cBlight Namako\u201d!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During cleanup, corrupted Namako known as &quot;Blight Namako&quot; may suddenly appear.<br>They rot your food and drag the ocean back into darkness.<br>Team up and repel them with the mighty Namako Fusion Cannon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/extras/36d705b31ded4bba97a6d1eb19ca38c3.poster.avif?t=1771564038\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/extras/36d705b31ded4bba97a6d1eb19ca38c3.webm?t=1771564038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/extras/36d705b31ded4bba97a6d1eb19ca38c3.mp4?t=1771564038\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master efficiency in Solo Mode!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play your way\u2014not just in multiplayer, but solo too!<br>All stages have been fine-tuned for solo play.<br>Perfect your strategy and aim for the best time!<br>Of course, taking it slow and steady is perfectly fine too!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Planning x RTS Gameplay: Strategize based on map structure and control multiple cucumbers simultaneously</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chaotic Cooperative Play: Plans may succeed... or hilariously fail\u2014every match brings its own story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online co-op matches where you can easily team up and play with friends or strangers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 50 Scenic Creatures: Discover real and fantasy species as you play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 Unique Stages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stage Titles Based on Clear Time</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adorable Sea Cucumbers &amp; a Hidden Post-Apocalyptic Worldview</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play Solo Mode: Relaxed or Fully Optimized.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New stages, mechanics, and more will be added in future updates.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Guidelines for Streaming and Video Posting</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streaming and Video Posting: OK (Very welcome!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monetization: OK</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prohibited Streaming Areas: None</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We would appreciate it if you could include a link to your Steam store page in the description.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Namako Has Begun","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3866920/faeb424bb594b57d454cf0f9fe3e460b33d17f0c.jpg"},{"name":"Warm-up Complete","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3866920/b1c91e4bc9627932485647ce965deca8d1d773e0.jpg"},{"name":"Great Hall Maintenance","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3866920/6bf2a2e61670eb669b31956f4ae14956b28e1594.jpg"},{"name":"Ruler of Fire and Ice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3866920/7f3543fc6008d540dc44523c3c4fadd383e42c0e.jpg"},{"name":"Beyond the Atoll Line","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3866920/8d4ea97d30b0f18e58142a211d4c625630b85e38.jpg"},{"name":"The Dance is Over","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3866920/6cd0df323391b25c2d5e1a87bf5fb70f97b4a0b1.jpg"},{"name":"In Safe Hands","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3866920/dc3d7b8e9c9039032a91fd754ba8b220a630ff72.jpg"},{"name":"Sieging the Castle","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3866920/1bd79a5bb26160dc2765e02c7606ac89975a2f6e.jpg"},{"name":"Rest in Peace, Promised Land","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3866920/0987f191cf49c52868e48ea8870f3c95d0844867.jpg"},{"name":"Namako Namako","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3866920/9182d9fbf22f658d7f7e6d7723293f99a97315e0.jpg"}],"total":21},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3866920?t=1771564038","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/96f5de646844fbba1653ae40a434a082200f2273/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771564038","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/d172b1de950c768ec2c544e2e044ace53498b249/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771564038","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/d172b1de950c768ec2c544e2e044ace53498b249/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771564038","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NAMAKORIUM is a chaotic, cooperative multiplayer RTS for up to four players.<br>Command the &quot;sea cleaners&quot;\u2014Namakos (sea cucumbers) left behind by humanity\u2014and clean up the polluted oceans!<br>Plus, Solo Mode lets you choose your style: take it slow and chill, or push for peak efficiency!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/extras/c015cd7c709039b957cb672d805cc085.poster.avif?t=1771564038\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/extras/c015cd7c709039b957cb672d805cc085.webm?t=1771564038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/extras/c015cd7c709039b957cb672d805cc085.mp4?t=1771564038\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you reclaim the beautiful sea?<br>It\u2019s all up to your planning skills, your friends, and your trusty sea cucumbers.<br>Get ready for a frantic, action-packed ocean cleanup operation!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Organize Your Namako Operation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command unique Namakos, gather resources, construct buildings, and clear paths\u2014the tasks are many and time is short.<br>Purify all the pollution before the food runs out!<br>Will your strategy hold up under pressure and succeed with the team?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/extras/d190327ffce1aad3c9d7d1127c8d5362.poster.avif?t=1771564038\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/extras/d190327ffce1aad3c9d7d1127c8d5362.webm?t=1771564038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/extras/d190327ffce1aad3c9d7d1127c8d5362.mp4?t=1771564038\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique Namakos with Special Traits</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shell Namako gathers limestone. Iron Namako is great at mining. Flame Namako and Ice Namako can survive extreme temperatures.<br>Use their distinct abilities to assign roles and conquer each stage together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/extras/397c5cde778c06561d615423330c3789.poster.avif?t=1771564038\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/extras/397c5cde778c06561d615423330c3789.webm?t=1771564038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/extras/397c5cde778c06561d615423330c3789.mp4?t=1771564038\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Restore the Ocean\u2019s Beauty</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you decontaminate, corals bloom, sunlight shines through, and the ocean regains vibrant color.<br>Over 50 types of &quot;Scenic Creatures&quot; will begin to swim in\u2014try to collect them all as you heal the seas!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/extras/3545ce50fbdfb601445d7ed972708cbc.poster.avif?t=1771564038\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/extras/3545ce50fbdfb601445d7ed972708cbc.webm?t=1771564038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/extras/3545ce50fbdfb601445d7ed972708cbc.mp4?t=1771564038\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Beware the \u201cBlight Namako\u201d!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During cleanup, corrupted Namako known as &quot;Blight Namako&quot; may suddenly appear.<br>They rot your food and drag the ocean back into darkness.<br>Team up and repel them with the mighty Namako Fusion Cannon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/extras/36d705b31ded4bba97a6d1eb19ca38c3.poster.avif?t=1771564038\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/extras/36d705b31ded4bba97a6d1eb19ca38c3.webm?t=1771564038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/extras/36d705b31ded4bba97a6d1eb19ca38c3.mp4?t=1771564038\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master efficiency in Solo Mode!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play your way\u2014not just in multiplayer, but solo too!<br>All stages have been fine-tuned for solo play.<br>Perfect your strategy and aim for the best time!<br>Of course, taking it slow and steady is perfectly fine too!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Planning x RTS Gameplay: Strategize based on map structure and control multiple cucumbers simultaneously</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chaotic Cooperative Play: Plans may succeed... or hilariously fail\u2014every match brings its own story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online co-op matches where you can easily team up and play with friends or strangers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 50 Scenic Creatures: Discover real and fantasy species as you play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 Unique Stages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stage Titles Based on Clear Time</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adorable Sea Cucumbers &amp; a Hidden Post-Apocalyptic Worldview</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play Solo Mode: Relaxed or Fully Optimized.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New stages, mechanics, and more will be added in future updates.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Guidelines for Streaming and Video Posting</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streaming and Video Posting: OK (Very welcome!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monetization: OK</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prohibited Streaming Areas: None</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We would appreciate it if you could include a link to your Steam store page in the description.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Polyscape Inc."],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866920/21ea604d38cb9d0577399f21637f6be1b653212d/header.jpg?t=1771564038","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3866920/681655600/95ec56b15cd30c747f75e4cdbbfaa4fc226d2bf4/1769610419/dash_av1.mpd?t=1769733256","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3866920/681655600/95ec56b15cd30c747f75e4cdbbfaa4fc226d2bf4/1769610419/dash_h264.mpd?t=1769733256","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3866920/681655600/95ec56b15cd30c747f75e4cdbbfaa4fc226d2bf4/1769610419/hls_26